Apply ComfyUI scaled-FP8 weight scales when reading safetensors

Without them a scaled-FP8 model imports 1/scale too large and renders a
solid colour. The archive is wrapped, rather than ModelWeightElement.scale
set, so a combined-source gather can carry a different scale per source.
